  "descriptionHtml": "<h4>DARKER ROAST FOR BOLDER DAYS.</h4>\n<p>Meet the yin to your yang. While you grit your teeth through the daily grind, know this bold and delicious dark roast brew will have your back all day long. Certified Fair Trade and Organic, our balanced blend of arabica beans for smooth flavor and robusta for natural strength will kick the midday crash to the curb. Find harmony, no matter the horrors your day has in store.</p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong>CAFFEINE CONTENT: </strong>Dark Roast Coffee contains approximately 180mg of caffeine based on a 6oz serving following brewing instructions on the package. Learn more about the caffeine content of all Death Wish Coffee products at <a title=\"Learn More About Death Wish Coffee Caffeine Content\" href=\"https://www.deathwishcoffee.com/pages/caffeine\">deathwishcoffee.com/caffeine</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>SUBSCRIBE &amp; SAVE:</strong> Join the Society of Strong Coffee to save 30% off your first shipment and up to 20% off future deliveries. Plus, unlock free shipping on all subscription orders and keep an eye out for exclusive access to upcoming releases.</p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><em>Unless specified in promotional messaging, coffee subscriptions are not eligible for additional discounts or promotional offers.</em></p>",
  "fullDescription": "DARKER ROAST FOR BOLDER DAYS. Meet the yin to your yang. While you grit your teeth through the daily grind, know this bold and delicious dark roast brew will have your back all day long. Certified Fair Trade and Organic, our balanced blend of arabica beans for smooth flavor and robusta for natural strength will kick the midday crash to the curb. Find harmony, no matter the horrors your day has in store. CAFFEINE CONTENT: Dark Roast Coffee contains approximately 180mg of caffeine based on a 6oz serving following brewing instructions on the package. Learn more about the caffeine content of all Death Wish Coffee products at deathwishcoffee.com/caffeine. SUBSCRIBE & SAVE: Join the Society of Strong Coffee to save 30% off your first shipment and up to 20% off future deliveries. Plus, unlock free shipping on all subscription orders and keep an eye out for exclusive access to upcoming releases. Unless specified in promotional messaging, coffee subscriptions are not eligible for additional discounts or promotional offers.",
  "seo": {
   "title": "Fiercely Strong Coffee | Dark Roast Coffee",
   "description": "Dark Roast. Bold flavor. Sourced from the highest-quality coffee beans in the world and roasted to deep, never-bitter perfection, with notes of dark chocolate + black cherry. This is a pound of power—basic brews not invited. "
  },
